          "book": "1TH",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "But concerning the times and the seasons, brothers, you have no need that anything be written to you.",
      "ko": "형제들아 때와 시기에 관하여는 너희에게 쓸 것이 없음은",
      "source_text_hash": "922b4088048028c62f7d82c78c16887927518c1f74efcc136cf72d77eee28d25",
      "translation_text_hash": "bfdcfc11bc30136fd160cb61bba88d89762d356decf3975cd8c0ca7b1d05aae4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "형제들아 때와 시기에 관하여는 너희에게 쓸 것이 없음은"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "bfdcfc11bc30136fd160cb61bba88d89762d356decf3975cd8c0ca7b1d05aae4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:1TH:5:2",
      "sequence": 29620,
      "chapter_label": "1TH 5",
      "verse_label": "2",
